# Shared Supabase Postgres instance (PostGIS enabled). This is NOT a personal local database --
# schema changes must be applied with `prisma migrate deploy`, never `migrate dev`, so they land
# as reviewed migrations rather than ad-hoc drift against a database other people also use.
#
# Get the real connection string from whoever manages the Supabase project for this app
# (ahmadmeer.dev@gmail.com) -- do not commit it. Use the "Session pooler" string from
# Supabase's dashboard (Project -> Connect -> Session pooler), not "Direct connection" (IPv6-only,
# unreachable on many networks) or "Transaction pooler" (its pooling mode blocks the schema-lock
# step `prisma migrate deploy` needs).
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres.<project-ref>:<password>@aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:5432/postgres"
